<title>BELGIUM: Colruyt 1995/96 profit up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Colruyt 1995/96 profit up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1995/96 financial year</p>
<p>(billion Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			   1.93 vs     1.73</p>
<p>Dividend (francs)  150 gross, 112.50 net</p>
<p>Note - Colruyt NV is a Belgian discount supermarket retailer. Dividend payable as of October 4.  </p>
<p>    Cash flow				   4.11 vs     3.60</p>
<p>    Turnover (excl. VAT)		   59.5  vs    52.9</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
